sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Record attendance and absences
    %% Stories: 2, 38, 54, 56
    %% Description: A guardian reports a child absent and the administrator is notified of the absence form. An administrator registers absences, and a teacher records the attendance of a class.
    actor GP as Guardian (person)
    actor AP as Administrator (person)
    actor TP as Teacher (person)
    participant GU as Guardian
    participant ST as Student
    participant ME as Message
    participant AD as Administrator
    participant AT as Attendance

    %% covers 2
    GP->>GU: report child absent
    GU->>ST: absent child
    GU->>ME: absence form
    %% covers 54
    ME->>AD: notify of absence form
    %% covers 56
    AP->>AT: register absence
    %% covers 38
    TP->>AT: record class attendance
